Akin to {{cog|cu|Дoунавъ}}, {{m|cu|Дᲂунавъ}}, from {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*Dunavь}}, from {{der|bg|got|*𐌳𐍉𐌽𐌰𐍅𐌹}}, from {{der|bg|gem-pro|*Dōnawjaz}}, from {{der|bg|cel-pro|*Dānowyos}} (whence also {{m|la|Danubius}}), an extended form of the river-name {{m|cel-pro|*Dānu}}, from {{der|bg|ine-pro|*déh₂nu||river goddess}}, akin to {{m|ine-pro|*dʰenh₂-||to set in motion; to flow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA|Ду́нав}}

